Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.54,0:00:04.56,Default,Ito,0,0,0,,Good morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.76,0:00:09.16,Default,Gen,0,0,0,,Have you properly talked\N to Mom since then?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.30,0:00:11.65,Default,Ito,0,0,0,,Yeah, thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.37,0:00:13.30,Default,Ito,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.90,0:00:17.16,Default,Ito,0,0,0,,There's one thing I'm wondering about.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.61,0:00:20.76,Flashback,Gen,0,0,0,,I won't lay a finger on Ito \Nas long as we're in this house.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.01,0:00:24.94,Flashback,Gen,0,0,0,,That's the rule I set for \Nmyself so that it's clear that
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.94,0:00:26.42,Flashback,Gen,0,0,0,,I'm not playing any games.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.14,0:00:29.76,Default,Ito,0,0,0,,What does "as long as \Nwe're in this house" mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.41,0:00:32.81,Default,Ito,0,0,0,,Does that mean you plan \Non leaving someday?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.69,0:00:34.81,Default,Gen,0,0,0,,{\i1}That's{\i0} your worry?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.16,0:00:36.43,Default,Ito,0,0,0,,It's important!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.00,0:00:38.90,Default,Gen,0,0,0,,We're already a huge family,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.90,0:00:41.19,Default,Gen,0,0,0,,I'll just be in the way if I stay forever!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.22,0:00:43.62,Italics,Ito(M),0,0,0,,So serious all of a sudden.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.28,0:00:46.28,Default,Ito,0,0,0,,I guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.65,0:00:50.40,Italics,Ito(M),0,0,0,,Well then, we'll end up \Nbeing separated one day?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.40,0:00:52.58,Default,Gen,0,0,0,,If you'll miss me that much, \Nwhy not come with?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.08,0:00:57.37,Default,Ito,0,0,0,,Can you not get all pervy out of nowhere?!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.37,0:00:58.14,Default,Gen,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.17,0:01:00.83,Default,Ito,0,0,0,,That would mean us living together!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.83,0:01:02.22,Default,Ito,0,0,0,,So that's like...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.83,0:01:03.83,Default,Ito,0,0,0,,Like...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.45,0:01:07.50,Default,Ito,0,0,0,,a marriage proposal.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.29,0:01:09.23,Default,Gen,0,0,0,,You...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.23,0:01:10.41,Default,Gen,0,0,0,,You're getting carried away!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.41,0:01:12.34,Default,Ito,0,0,0,,No, {\i1}you{\i0} are!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.34,0:01:14.67,Default,Ito,0,0,0,,And anyway, I said I love you,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.67,0:01:16.35,Default,Ito,0,0,0,,but not that I'd go out with you!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.35,0:01:18.04,Default,Gen,0,0,0,,What kind of weird-ass rule is that?!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.04,0:01:20.34,Default,Ito,0,0,0,,Says the guy making the weird-ass rules!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.34,0:01:22.65,Default,Gen,0,0,0,,Quit complaining when \NI'm trying to be accountable!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.65,0:01:23.71,Default,Ito,0,0,0,,Oh, I'm sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.71,0:01:26.23,Default,Ito,0,0,0,,I almost passed out \Nbecause that was so cool!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.39,0:01:32.77,Default,Ito,0,0,0,,When I realized that you're \Nbeing so considerate for me,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.62,0:01:35.62,Default,Ito,0,0,0,,it made me incredibly happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.14,0:01:40.47,Default,Ito,0,0,0,,What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.99,0:01:42.23,Default,Gen,0,0,0,,Never you mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.35,0:01:48.00,Default,Ito,0,0,0,,So, what did you really mean by that?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.99,0:01:50.35,Default,Gen,0,0,0,,Take it however you want.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.77,0:02:13.82,Title,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(4965,0)\fs30\pos(320,30)\frz-30\t(0,4278,\frz0\fs26}P{\c&H7432D8&}l{\c&H000000&}e{\c&H7432D8&}a{\c&H000000&}s{\c&H7432D8&}e {\c&H000000&}E{\c&H7432D8&}x{\c&H000000&}c{\c&H7432D8&}u{\c&H000000&}s{\c&H7432D8&}e {\c&HAF4072&}My {\c&H7432D8&}Younger {\c&H000000&}Brothers
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.97,0:03:31.00,Ep_Title,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,455)\blur1\3c&HE8E8E8&\3a&H58&\fscx77\2a&HFF&\ko3.3}E{\ko3.3}p{\ko3.3}i{\ko3.3}s{\ko3.3}o{\ko3.3}d{\ko3.3}e {\ko3.3}2{\ko3.3}0{\ko3.3}: {\c&HA27492&\ko3.3}H{\ko3.3}e{\ko3.3}a{\ko3.3}r{\ko3.3}t{\ko3.3}s{\c&H171620&} {\ko3.3}A{\ko3.3}l{\ko3.3}i{\ko3.3}g{\ko3.3}n{\ko3.3}e{\ko3.3}d{\ko3.3}, {\c&H7339DD&\ko3.3}W{\ko3.3}h{\c&H171620&\ko3.3}a{\ko3.3}t{\ko3.3}'{\ko3.3}s {\ko3.3}N{\ko3.3}e{\ko3.3}x{\ko3.3}t{\ko3.3}?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.41,0:03:25.49,Italics,Ito(M),0,0,0,,{\an8}Dear Mother,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.49,0:03:27.58,Italics,Ito(M),0,0,0,,{\an8}I hope this letter finds you well.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.12,0:03:31.15,Italics,Ito(M),0,0,0,,{\an8}With your blessing, we're all lovey-dovey.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.15,0:03:32.65,Default,Gen,0,0,0,,I'm back.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.47,0:03:35.25,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,Welcome back, Gen-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.25,0:03:36.89,Default,Raku,0,0,0,,Tired from work?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.89,0:03:39.67,Default,Shu,0,0,0,,Just so you know, Ito-chan's under there.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.62,0:03:42.86,Italics,Ito(M),0,0,0,,I'm sorry, that was a lie.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.86,0:03:46.12,Italics,Ito(M),0,0,0,,We're just being a regular old "family."
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.68,0:03:50.55,Italics,Ito(M),0,0,0,,In a certain way, you could say \Nour days are going... well?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.12,0:03:53.75,Default,Ito,0,0,0,,You're quitting your job?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.75,0:03:56.61,Default,Gen,0,0,0,,Once I'm done training the new hire.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.12,0:04:00.99,Default,Gen,0,0,0,,Did you forget I also need \Nto study for entrance exams?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.99,0:04:01.62,Default,Ito,0,0,0,,Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.03,0:04:05.27,Default,Ito,0,0,0,,Right, and it's almost summer break.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.27,0:04:07.10,Default,Gen,0,0,0,,We can't afford to be careless.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.41,0:04:11.11,Default,Ito,0,0,0,,Sometimes, the things you say are \Nso utterly true that it scares me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.11,0:04:12.76,Default,Gen,0,0,0,,I have to be that way.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.18,0:04:15.05,Default,Gen,0,0,0,,If I'm not doing everything I need to,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.05,0:04:19.28,Default,Gen,0,0,0,,we can't tell what our parents \Nwill say about us two.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.94,0:04:25.29,Italics,Ito(M),0,0,0,,Does he mean he's doing everything \Nhe can for our future?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.40,0:04:27.44,Default,Gen,0,0,0,,What about you?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.79,0:04:30.05,Default,Gen,0,0,0,,You've figured out what \Nyou want to do, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.47,0:04:33.92,Default,Ito,0,0,0,,I was planning to do that \Nduring summer break.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.43,0:04:37.30,Italics,Raku(M),0,0,0,,That's finally some weight \Noff my shoulders...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.02,0:04:41.30,Italics,Raku(M),0,0,0,,I was so worried about those two \NI couldn't help myself,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.02,0:04:45.04,Italics,Raku(M),0,0,0,,but I really should stop handling\N other people's problems...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.04,0:04:46.31,Default,MStudent1,0,0,0,,Yashiro-chan!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.74,0:04:49.02,Default,Yashiro,0,0,0,,My proper name is Yashiro-sensei.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.02,0:04:50.75,Default,MStudent1,0,0,0,,Sure, sure. Got a boyfriend yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.75,0:04:52.31,Default,Yashiro,0,0,0,,I'm very busy with work.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.31,0:04:54.43,Default,MStudent2,0,0,0,,That sounds pretty lonely.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.43,0:04:56.28,Default,MStudent2,0,0,0,,But we could keep you company.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.28,0:04:58.73,Default,MStudent3,0,0,0,,I could totally see myself with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.16,0:05:01.23,Default,MStudent3,0,0,0,,My bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.03,0:05:06.45,Default,Raku,0,0,0,,Yashiro-sensei, may I ask \Nyou a question about class?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.83,0:05:09.70,Default,MStudent3,0,0,0,,Shit!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.70,0:05:11.25,Default,MStudent1,0,0,0,,It's the Narita Gorilla's brother!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.58,0:05:16.08,Default,Raku,0,0,0,,Guys like that just don't listen,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.08,0:05:17.59,Default,Raku,0,0,0,,so you should be careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.03,0:05:21.85,Default,Raku,0,0,0,,Maybe you could try getting \Na scary boyfriend?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.85,0:05:24.49,Default,Yashiro,0,0,0,,What you're saying also \Nconstitutes sexual harassment.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.43,0:05:29.98,Default,Yashiro,0,0,0,,I seem to be constantly causing you worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.53,0:05:32.18,Default,Yashiro,0,0,0,,But you can rest easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.18,0:05:34.42,Default,Yashiro,0,0,0,,Since then, I've actually \Ncompletely recovered.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.42,0:05:35.86,Default,Yashiro,0,0,0,,I'm even looking for a spouse.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.24,0:05:38.45,Default,Yashiro,0,0,0,,What's that face?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.42,0:05:41.72,Default,Raku,0,0,0,,It's my "I'm nothing but worried" face.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.03,0:05:45.62,Default,Yashiro,0,0,0,,That's quite rude, given you \Nstarted this conversation.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.84,0:05:47.62,Default,Raku,0,0,0,,But your track record with men is—
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.32,0:05:51.72,Default,Raku,0,0,0,,Never mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.72,0:05:54.79,Default,Yashiro,0,0,0,,I am aware that I lack good \Njudgment when it comes to men.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.18,0:05:58.56,Default,Yashiro,0,0,0,,But I won't get anywhere \Nif I don't at least try.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.30,0:06:00.76,Default,Yashiro,0,0,0,,It'll be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.76,0:06:03.38,Default,Yashiro,0,0,0,,My friend also managed to \Nfind someone with that thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.38,0:06:04.54,Italics,Raku(M),0,0,0,,That thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.60,0:06:07.70,Default,Yashiro,0,0,0,,It's really convenient these days.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.03,0:06:11.68,Default,Yashiro,0,0,0,,All you have to do is sign up on an \Napp and then you can find partners.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.68,0:06:13.89,Italics,Raku(M),0,0,0,,So that's what she's doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.49,0:06:17.16,Default,Raku,0,0,0,,But finding someone also \Nrequires some techniques.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.13,0:06:22.27,Default,Raku,0,0,0,,By the way, what kind of picture \Ndo you have on your profile?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.31,0:06:26.05,Default,Yashiro,0,0,0,,A regular picture of me at home.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.38,0:06:27.53,Default,Yashiro,0,0,0,,I took it myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.00,0:06:29.16,Default,Raku,0,0,0,,Please show me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.16,0:06:30.32,Default,Yashiro,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.91,0:06:33.91,Default,Yashiro,0,0,0,,It's not something to show to a student.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.49,0:06:36.67,Default,Yashiro,0,0,0,,And this is none of your business.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.67,0:06:40.06,Default,Raku,0,0,0,,What I'm talking about \Nis on another level.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.06,0:06:43.26,Default,Raku,0,0,0,,I'm trying to help someone about to get \Ninto an accident right in front of me!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.74,0:06:48.34,Default - Top,Yashiro,0,0,0,,Calling it an accident is uncalled for.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.74,0:06:50.13,Sign,Sign,0,0,0,,{\c&HA085DC&\bord0\fs12\pos(477.565,256.348)}Like!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.74,0:06:50.13,Sign,Sign,0,0,0,,{\c&HA085DC&\fsp1\bord2\fs20\3c&HFBFAF8&\pos(340.522,309.913)}Yashiro, 24 years old
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.34,0:06:50.13,Default - Top,Raku,0,0,0,,This is an accident.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.27,0:06:54.11,Default,Raku,0,0,0,,You broke a bone on \Nthe crucial first step.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.48,0:06:57.47,Default,Raku,0,0,0,,Why are you not freaked out \Nthat this got zero likes?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.47,0:06:59.52,Default,Yashiro,0,0,0,,Because I just started.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.52,0:07:00.60,Default,Raku,0,0,0,,Naive.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.60,0:07:03.28,Default,Raku,0,0,0,,At this rate, it could take years.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.28,0:07:05.31,Default,Raku,0,0,0,,First off, your outfit is no good.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.31,0:07:07.33,Default,Raku,0,0,0,,This isn't an interview for a company.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.33,0:07:10.14,Default,Raku,0,0,0,,No thought to your surroundings, \Nand an assassin's expression.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.14,0:07:12.79,Default,Raku,0,0,0,,You just look like bad news, all around.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.18,0:07:15.65,Default,Raku,0,0,0,,You've got such a pretty face,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.65,0:07:18.79,Default,Raku,0,0,0,,but absolutely none of that \Ncomes across here.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.61,0:07:23.39,Default,Yashiro,0,0,0,,Now that you mention it,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.39,0:07:25.80,Default,Yashiro,0,0,0,,that might be a horrible picture.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.80,0:07:27.78,Italics,Raku(M),0,0,0,,I shouldn't have said that!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.93,0:07:31.81,Default,Yashiro,0,0,0,,No mercy, like always.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.51,0:07:37.56,Default,Yashiro,0,0,0,,But those were clear and \Nreasonable pointers.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.99,0:07:43.26,Default,Yashiro,0,0,0,,I never thought a student \Nwould call me an assassin,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.59,0:07:45.94,Default,Yashiro,0,0,0,,but since it was funny, I'll let it slide.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.03,0:07:50.42,Default,Raku,0,0,0,,Oh, sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.42,0:07:51.70,Default,Raku,0,0,0,,I just took a picture.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.07,0:07:54.49,Default,Raku,0,0,0,,The background and stuff was good,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.49,0:07:56.00,Default,Raku,0,0,0,,so I thought it'd be a good reference.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.19,0:08:02.22,Default,Raku,0,0,0,,Anyway, the rest is up to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.05,0:08:08.60,Italics,Raku(M),0,0,0,,What was that just now?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.86,0:08:11.53,Italics,Raku(M),0,0,0,,Was I in too deep?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.45,0:08:15.22,Italics,Raku(M),0,0,0,,When she suddenly made that face,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.22,0:08:19.30,Italics,Raku(M),0,0,0,,I couldn't help but think \Nthat she's quite cute.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.09,0:08:22.73,Default,Rio,0,0,0,,What we're doing for summer break?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.96,0:08:27.61,Default,Mone,0,0,0,,We're going to go to the open campuses \Nof all the beauty schools.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.61,0:08:29.81,Default,Ito,0,0,0,,You're both going to be beauticians?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.81,0:08:32.31,Default,Rio,0,0,0,,I'm gonna to be a super nail technician.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.31,0:08:33.12,Default,Rio,0,0,0,,What about you?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.62,0:08:39.12,Default,Ito,0,0,0,,I guess the end goal is to \Nbecome a government worker?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.12,0:08:40.96,Default,Rio,0,0,0,,You're staying in school then, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.96,0:08:42.30,Default,Rio,0,0,0,,Did you pick a university?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.29,0:08:44.45,Default,Ito,0,0,0,,Not yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.45,0:08:45.84,Default,Mone,0,0,0,,That's rough!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.16,0:08:49.59,Default,Mone,0,0,0,,But like, you're not the scholarly type,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.59,0:08:51.84,Default,Mone,0,0,0,,so you don't exactly have \Nevery option available.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.84,0:08:52.93,Default,Mone,0,0,0,,Guess that makes it easy?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.21,0:08:57.06,Default,Rio,0,0,0,,For real. Like, what is \Nthere to be picky about?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.48,0:09:00.18,Default,Ito,0,0,0,,Hey, let me be a little picky!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.18,0:09:02.10,Default,Ito,0,0,0,,My choice will affect how my life goes!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.10,0:09:04.48,Default,Rio,0,0,0,,Huh, so what's so important?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.73,0:09:06.44,Default,Ito,0,0,0,,That I can commute there from home!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.61,0:09:12.51,Italics,Ito(M),0,0,0,,Is that good enough?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.51,0:09:14.65,Italics,Ito(M),0,0,0,,But it is important.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.01,0:09:17.49,Italics,Ito(M),0,0,0,,Though, is it even okay \Nfor me to go to college?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.22,0:09:21.00,Italics,Ito(M),0,0,0,,When I asked my parents about it...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.00,0:09:22.18,Flashback,Isao,0,0,0,,Don't worry!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.18,0:09:23.98,Flashback,Isao,0,0,0,,We'll still be working for quite a while!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.98,0:09:26.67,Flashback,Mom,0,0,0,,Follow your dreams, Ito-chan!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.98,0:09:32.79,Italics,Ito(M),0,0,0,,Or so they said, but... \Nwhat are my dreams?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.97,0:09:37.76,Default,Gen,0,0,0,,Dreams? Sure, I have 'em.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.76,0:09:39.50,Default,Gen,0,0,0,,Like being a cop or a firefighter.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.83,0:09:41.39,Default,Gen,0,0,0,,Or a PE teacher.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.39,0:09:42.74,Default,Ito,0,0,0,,You're full of dreams!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.74,0:09:44.11,Default,Gen,0,0,0,,That's good, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.11,0:09:45.22,Default,Ito,0,0,0,,Sheesh, fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.22,0:09:48.08,Default,Ito,0,0,0,,You can take my college exams too,\N since I have nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.30,0:09:52.94,Default,Gen,0,0,0,,There's no rule saying you can't go to\N college unless you have a specific goal.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.40,0:09:56.42,Default,Gen,0,0,0,,I mean, seeing as it's you,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.42,0:09:59.04,Default,Gen,0,0,0,,I bet you haven't let yourself \Nthink about your own life.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.31,0:10:04.23,Default,Gen,0,0,0,,I think going to college just to \Nconsider all sorts of things is fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.19,0:10:09.42,Default,Gen,0,0,0,,And in the worst case, I'm totally \Nprepared to provide for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.22,0:10:12.72,Default,Gen,0,0,0,,Take your time figuring out \Nwhat you want to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.97,0:10:17.68,Default,Ito,0,0,0,,I-I-It's not like I asked you \Nbecause I was angling for that!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.68,0:10:18.82,Default,Gen,0,0,0,,It's a joke.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.82,0:10:21.29,Default,Ito,0,0,0,,Weird, 'cause jokes are\N supposed to be funny!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.29,0:10:22.81,Default,Gen,0,0,0,,Yeah, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.02,0:10:26.52,Sign,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fs10\fax0.1\3c&HA7E3E5&\c&H76A5A8&\frz11.08\pos(77.914,57.043)}College Entrance Exam
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.02,0:10:26.52,Sign,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fs18\fnImpact\fscx140\fsp0.8\shad0.3\fax0.1\bord0\frz11.08\c&HE1DEE1&\4c&H544939&\pos(91.13,88)}Basic Mathematics
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.02,0:10:26.52,Sign,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fs13\bord1.5\fax0.1\3c&HE2DFE2&\c&H9F9068&\frz12.46\pos(113.739,190.262)}Practice + Detailed Analysis
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.02,0:10:26.52,Sign,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fs11\fnTimes New Roman\fax0.1\3c&HDBD6D9&\c&HB49F74&\frz12.79\pos(126.262,218.087)}Math II / III / B / C
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.02,0:10:26.52,Sign,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fs8\fax0.1\bord2\3c&H544B93&\c&HCFCCDA&\frz15.42\pos(24.696,278.609)}Revised Edition
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.02,0:10:26.52,Sign,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fs10\fnTimes New Roman\fscx80\fax-0.4\bord0\c&HCFCCDA&\frz347.5\pos(477.565,59.478)}Revised Edition
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.02,0:10:26.52,Sign,Sign,0,0,0,,{\an7\fs12\shad0.8\fnTimes New Roman\fax-0.4\bord0\c&HDBDBDB&\frz347.5\pos(500.174,58.782)\4c&H012901&}\h\h\h\hPractice / Detailed\N{\fs14}\h Math II / III / B\N {\fscx90}Real Exams From Prior Years
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.02,0:10:26.52,Sign,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fs10\fnTimes New Roman\fax-0.2\bord2\3c&H355333&\c&H86B281&\frz344\pos(542.26,261.217)}College Entrance Exams: Basic Level
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.42,0:10:26.52,Italics,Ito(M),0,0,0,,This is really hard.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.14,0:10:29.84,Italics,Ito(M),0,0,0,,Am I even going to make it into college?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.84,0:10:32.83,Italics,Ito(M),0,0,0,,I might not be able to go \Nanywhere this summer break.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.30,0:10:36.26,Default,Raku,0,0,0,,But then again, it's the last \Nsummer break in high school.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.26,0:10:38.24,Default,Raku,0,0,0,,You probably wanna \Ngo make some memories.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.24,0:10:39.39,Default,Ito,0,0,0,,Exactly!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.39,0:10:42.15,Default,Raku,0,0,0,,And be lovey-dovey with \NGen if given the chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.15,0:10:43.16,Default,Ito,0,0,0,,Exa...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.16,0:10:45.27,Default,Ito,0,0,0,,Stop reading my mind!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.27,0:10:48.03,Default,Raku,0,0,0,,Well, I haven't seen you \Ntwo interact lately.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.03,0:10:50.25,Default,Ito,0,0,0,,It seems like he's quite busy with work.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.86,0:10:54.13,Default,Raku,0,0,0,,Ma'am, when was the last time \Nyou talked to your husband?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.35,0:10:55.92,Default,Ito,0,0,0,,We talked today.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.08,0:10:58.34,Flashback,Ito,0,0,0,,You want dinner?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.34,0:11:00.07,Flashback,Gen,0,0,0,,I'll be late, so no.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.07,0:11:01.01,Flashback,Ito,0,0,0,,Got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.01,0:11:02.39,Default,Raku,0,0,0,,That's not a conversation.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.39,0:11:03.72,Default,Raku,0,0,0,,That's talking shop.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.11,0:11:05.50,Default,Ito,0,0,0,,Is that weird?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.50,0:11:08.02,Default,Raku,0,0,0,,It's fine, if you're okay with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.24,0:11:11.40,Default,Raku,0,0,0,,It just seems like you're living \Napart, in the same house.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.91,0:11:14.99,Default,Raku,0,0,0,,I just wanted to tell you that \Nyou can always come talk to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.44,0:11:17.97,Italics,Ito(M),0,0,0,,Is that how we seem?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.97,0:11:19.24,Italics,Ito(M),0,0,0,,I guess he's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.52,0:11:22.24,Italics,Ito(M),0,0,0,,We do barely see each other lately.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.98,0:11:27.45,Italics,Ito(M),0,0,0,,He passed out again.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.72,0:11:29.50,Default,Ito,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.94,0:11:31.42,Default,Ito,0,0,0,,Get up, take a bath, brush your teeth,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.42,0:11:32.49,Default,Ito,0,0,0,,and then go to bed.
