Dialogue: 1,0:11:34.36,0:11:36.52,Italics,Raku,0,0,0,,Syu's online right now.
Dialogue: 1,0:11:36.87,0:11:38.42,Italics,Raku,0,0,0,,I put Rui to bed,
Dialogue: 1,0:11:38.42,0:11:39.93,Italics,Raku,0,0,0,,so enjoy.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.64,0:11:45.31,Italics,Ito(M),0,0,0,,What's "enjoy" supposed to mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.47,0:11:50.09,Italics,Ito(M),0,0,0,,Well, if you insist,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.09,0:11:53.15,Italics,Ito(M),0,0,0,,I suppose I will take \Nyou up on that offer.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.49,0:11:56.25,Italics,Ito(M),0,0,0,,Yay! I got it!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.68,0:12:00.91,Italics,Ito(M),0,0,0,,Now I can secretly get my dose of \NGen replenishment whenever I...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.91,0:12:02.01,Default,Gen,0,0,0,,Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.01,0:12:04.86,Default,Gen,0,0,0,,Who the hell took this bullshit order?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.86,0:12:06.83,Default,Ito,0,0,0,,I'm sorry! I'm sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.28,0:12:08.93,Default,Gen,0,0,0,,Hm?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.51,0:12:11.46,Default,Gen,0,0,0,,Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.46,0:12:13.38,Default,Gen,0,0,0,,Looks like I had a work stress dream.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.64,0:12:14.93,Default,Ito,0,0,0,,Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.93,0:12:16.98,Default,Ito,0,0,0,,You're probably pushing yourself too hard.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.98,0:12:18.38,Default,Gen,0,0,0,,I'm fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.11,0:12:20.76,Default,Gen,0,0,0,,Is everyone else asleep?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.04,0:12:24.79,Default,Ito,0,0,0,,Shu-kun's playing a game, \Nbut the other two are asleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.79,0:12:25.76,Default,Ito,0,0,0,,Probably.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.76,0:12:26.98,Default,Gen,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.98,0:12:28.66,Default,Ito,0,0,0,,Hey, what the...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.66,0:12:30.19,Default,Gen,0,0,0,,I'm not doing anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.24,0:12:34.11,Default,Gen,0,0,0,,Just recharging a bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.86,0:12:37.23,Italics,Ito(M),0,0,0,,Whoa, where'd this come from?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.23,0:12:39.62,Default,Ito,0,0,0,,W-Well, if it's just a little bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.86,0:12:48.95,Sign,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fs11\fnTimes New Roman\bord0\c&H42454D&\pos(602,95)}Reiwa\N{\fs8}(Narita Rui)
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.86,0:12:48.95,Sign,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fs12\fscx90\fnTimes New Roman\bord0\c&H42454D&\pos(533.333,90)}River fun \N{\fs8}(Narita Rui)
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.34,0:12:45.22,Default,Gen,0,0,0,,Right. Do you have any \Nfree time next week?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.22,0:12:46.40,Default,Ito,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.40,0:12:48.29,Default,Gen,0,0,0,,Wanna go somewhere for summer break?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.29,0:12:48.96,Default,Ito,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.37,0:12:52.96,Default,Gen,0,0,0,,Might as well have fun \Nfor at least one day.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.48,0:12:57.43,Default,Ito,0,0,0,,Did you eat something \Nweird off the ground?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.43,0:12:58.05,Default,Gen,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.05,0:12:59.65,Default,Ito,0,0,0,,You're being all nice outta nowhere!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.65,0:13:01.96,Default,Gen,0,0,0,,I was just asking you in a normal way.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.96,0:13:04.22,Default,Ito,0,0,0,,Just the two of us? So what, a date?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.22,0:13:06.38,Default,Gen,0,0,0,,What? Don't want to?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.38,0:13:07.33,Default,Ito,0,0,0,,I didn't say that.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.33,0:13:08.85,Default,Ito,0,0,0,,It was so sudden, I freaked out.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.11,0:13:10.69,Default,Ito,0,0,0,,Ow, ow, ow!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.69,0:13:13.24,Default,Ito,0,0,0,,{\fscx120}You've never done that\N before now, is all.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.24,0:13:15.29,Default,Gen,0,0,0,,Are {\i1}you{\i0} okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.63,0:13:20.07,Default,Gen,0,0,0,,Aren't we beyond just siblings now,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.07,0:13:21.96,Default,Gen,0,0,0,,but two people who like each other?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.26,0:13:24.18,Default,Gen,0,0,0,,What the hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.62,0:13:27.10,Default,Gen,0,0,0,,I'm not the only one who \Nfeels like that, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.78,0:13:33.70,Italics,Ito(M),0,0,0,,What happened?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.13,0:13:37.37,Default,Both,0,0,0,,Humangers!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.37,0:13:39.09,Default,Both,0,0,0,,On the scene!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.09,0:13:40.36,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,Space gorilla!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.36,0:13:41.63,Default,Shu,0,0,0,,Prepare yourself!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.47,0:13:43.76,Sign,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fnComic Sans MS\fsp3\bord0\fs25\c&H26231F&\pos(132.174,17.391)}Space \NGorilla
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.35,0:13:46.29,Default,Raku,0,0,0,,Damn, that's sexy.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.77,0:13:49.95,Default,Raku,0,0,0,,Are you two trying to ascend \Nto adulthood this summer?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.29,0:13:49.92,Default - Top,Raku/Rui,0,0,0,,This is for Ito!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.95,0:13:51.26,Default,Ito,0,0,0,,We're not.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.26,0:13:53.85,Default,Ito,0,0,0,,He swore not to lay a hand on me\N while we're still in the house.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.28,0:13:59.15,Default,Ito,0,0,0,,It was a promise... right?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.15,0:14:01.29,Default,Raku,0,0,0,,You suddenly don't sound so sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.29,0:14:05.11,Default,Ito,0,0,0,,So anyway, he's talking \Nabout going to the beach...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.37,0:14:08.34,Default,Ito,0,0,0,,Where do you think that came from?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.34,0:14:09.99,Default,Ito,0,0,0,,Or am I reading too much into it?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.59,0:14:13.88,Default,Raku,0,0,0,,If you're sensing a deeper meaning \Nin his words, isn't that a sign
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.88,0:14:15.73,Default,Raku,0,0,0,,that your relationship has changed?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.18,0:14:19.73,Default,Raku,0,0,0,,I don't think you have \Nto analyze it too much.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.73,0:14:22.13,Default,Raku,0,0,0,,He's probably just trying \Nto let off some steam.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.79,0:14:24.42,Default,Ito,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.42,0:14:26.54,Default,Ito,0,0,0,,He has been working a lot lately.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.54,0:14:28.89,Default,Raku,0,0,0,,I think he's also feeling \Nthe exam pressure.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.23,0:14:30.60,Default,Raku,0,0,0,,With his academic powers,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.60,0:14:33.39,Default,Raku,0,0,0,,it's a bit dubious if he can \Neven manage the entrance exams.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.40,0:14:35.31,Default,Ito,0,0,0,,Savage.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.61,0:14:38.25,Sign,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fnComic Sans MS\fsp1\fax0.3\bord0\fs20\c&H26231F&\frz333.5\move(200,254,238.261,283.217,1300,1558)\t(1300,1558,\frz348)}Space Gorilla
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.82,0:14:40.15,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,Wow!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.15,0:14:42.44,Default,Shu,0,0,0,,Shooting games are my thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.69,0:14:46.47,Default,Raku,0,0,0,,Oh yeah, and there's a talk you'll \Nnever have, because it's Gen.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.65,0:14:49.85,Default,Raku,0,0,0,,"By the way, I was having\N an affair on the DL."
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.85,0:14:51.95,Default,Raku,0,0,0,,You hear that quite often.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.95,0:14:54.61,Default,Ito,0,0,0,,Oh, really?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.61,0:14:56.20,Default,Raku,0,0,0,,But it's Gen.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.20,0:14:58.55,Default,Ito,0,0,0,,I know that. So, never ever.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.55,0:15:00.46,Default,Ito,0,0,0,,'Cause it's Gen!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.97,0:15:06.27,Sign,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,60)\an2\fsp1\bord2\c&H423B3A&\3c&HF1EAE9&\pos(320,291.565)}*Easily influenced by an offhand comment
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.34,0:15:06.57,Italics,Ito(M),0,0,0,,{\an8}Seriously?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.47,0:15:10.42,Italics,Ito(M),0,0,0,,I need to stop thinking \Nall these weird things!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.76,0:15:14.70,Default,Ito,0,0,0,,Welcome back!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.74,0:15:19.23,Default,Gen,0,0,0,,You're still up?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.23,0:15:23.22,Default,Ito,0,0,0,,I was worried you might fall \Nasleep in a random spot again.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.22,0:15:26.04,Default,Gen,0,0,0,,Worry about yourself, not about me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.04,0:15:27.80,Default,Gen,0,0,0,,I hope you're studying.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.80,0:15:28.94,Default,Ito,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.94,0:15:31.11,Default,Ito,0,0,0,,But I'm doing that even \Nwithout the reminder.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.46,0:15:38.26,Default,Ito,0,0,0,,So I was thinking I'd end\N the day after I see your face...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.12,0:15:39.38,Sign,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fnComic Sans MS\fs25\bord4\c&HC0DD77&\3c&HEEFFF5&}Tousle, tousle, tousle
Dialogue: 1,0:15:36.12,0:15:39.38,Sign,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fnComic Sans MS\fs25\c&HC0DD77&\bord1\3c&H8AA255&}Tousle, tousle, tousle
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.38,0:15:40.13,Default,Ito,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.13,0:15:42.69,Default - Top,Ito,0,0,0,,I'm talking to you!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.09,0:15:43.63,Italics,Ito(M),0,0,0,,Gen rarely says how he feels.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.71,0:15:48.89,Italics,Ito(M),0,0,0,,I know he doesn't want to cause \Nthe people around him to worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.36,0:15:52.30,Italics,Ito(M),0,0,0,,But I want to hear his \Nconcerns about exams.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.30,0:15:53.68,Italics,Ito(M),0,0,0,,His complaints about work.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.56,0:15:56.81,Italics,Ito(M),0,0,0,,I want to get all of him,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.85,0:16:00.06,Italics,Ito(M),0,0,0,,but are there things he can't tell me,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.06,0:16:02.27,Italics,Ito(M),0,0,0,,even when we're this close?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.87,0:16:03.94,Italics,Ito(M),0,0,0,,Or does that mean...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.77,0:16:11.56,Italics,Ito(M),0,0,0,,that he still doesn't consider me \Nsomeone who can handle it?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.52,0:16:16.65,Italics,Ito(M),0,0,0,,Is that why it always feels \Nlike he's brushing me off?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.71,0:16:25.06,Italics,Ito(M),0,0,0,,He always tells me to \Nstay away from his work,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.06,0:16:28.23,Italics,Ito(M),0,0,0,,but I'd like to see what he's \Nlike in the outside world.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.23,0:16:30.18,Default,Devil,0,0,0,,You won't admit it, will you?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.18,0:16:33.63,Default,Devil,0,0,0,,You're only here because you're \Nworried he's cheating on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.63,0:16:34.67,Default,Angel,0,0,0,,That's not true!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.67,0:16:37.77,Default,Angel,0,0,0,,This is a girl's pure wish\N to know all of him.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.54,0:16:40.73,Italics,Ito(M),0,0,0,,What the hell am I even doing here?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.21,0:16:43.06,Italics,Ito(M),0,0,0,,Even if we like each other,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.06,0:16:45.25,Italics,Ito(M),0,0,0,,there will be things we \Ndon't want the other to see.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.72,0:16:48.30,Italics,Ito(M),0,0,0,,Gen's showing off is probably in his DNA.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.95,0:16:50.24,Italics,Ito(M),0,0,0,,But sometimes...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.09,0:16:53.74,Italics,Ito(M),0,0,0,,He does let his guard down like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.31,0:16:55.96,Italics,Ito(M),0,0,0,,Isn't that what he wants?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.96,0:16:59.82,Italics,Ito(M),0,0,0,,Someone who will allow him \Nto do that when he needs it?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.08,0:17:04.38,Italics,Ito(M),0,0,0,,Yeah, I'm just gonna go home,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.38,0:17:07.26,Italics,Ito(M),0,0,0,,and make a midnight snack to \Ncure his summer heat fatigue.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.82,0:17:12.39,Italics,Ito(M),0,0,0,,All I need to do is take in what Gen \Nchooses to show me at face value.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.86,0:17:13.63,Default,Gen,0,0,0,,Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.02,0:17:16.77,Default,Gen,0,0,0,,Stop the useless gossiping.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.77,0:17:18.08,Default,Gen,0,0,0,,Time to go home.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.08,0:17:21.39,Default,Mahiru,0,0,0,,You're seriously walking \Nme home today, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.39,0:17:22.76,Default,Gen,0,0,0,,Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.76,0:17:25.19,Default,Gen,0,0,0,,Summer means a ton of \Nshady guys swarming around.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.19,0:17:27.44,Default,Mahiru,0,0,0,,You're so sweet!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.44,0:17:30.74,Default,Mahiru,0,0,0,,I'm gonna fall for you, for real.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.82,0:17:33.16,Default,Mahiru,0,0,0,,Come on, be honest now.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.16,0:17:34.74,Default,Mahiru,0,0,0,,You're in love with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.07,0:17:36.22,Default,Gen,0,0,0,,Say what you want.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.22,0:17:38.60,Default,Mahiru,0,0,0,,You're blushing! That's hilarious!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.60,0:17:39.44,Italics,Ito(M),0,0,0,,Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.48,0:17:44.33,Italics,Ito(M),0,0,0,,Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.14,0:17:47.67,Default,Gen,0,0,0,,What are you doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.67,0:17:50.38,Italics,Ito(M),0,0,0,,Heeeeeeey!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.88,0:17:53.30,Default,Mahiru,0,0,0,,You know her?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.75,0:17:56.38,Default,Ito,0,0,0,,Thank you for always taking \Ncare of my little brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.38,0:17:57.52,Default,Ito,0,0,0,,It's nice to meet you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.52,0:18:00.06,Default,Ito,0,0,0,,I'm the oldest sister \Nof the Narita household.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.06,0:18:01.31,Default,Ito,0,0,0,,I'm Narita Ito.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.58,0:18:04.09,Default,Mahiru,0,0,0,,Hey, hey, boss! So she's your li'l sister?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.41,0:18:05.56,Default,Gen,0,0,0,,No. My older sister.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.94,0:18:06.98,Default,Mahiru,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.09,0:18:10.44,Default,Mahiru,0,0,0,,No way! She's your big sister?!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.44,0:18:11.69,Default,Gen,0,0,0,,Stepsister.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.69,0:18:13.49,Default,Mahiru,0,0,0,,You don't look anything alike!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.49,0:18:14.70,Default,Gen,0,0,0,,'Cause she's my stepsister.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.70,0:18:16.58,Default,Ito,0,0,0,,Speaking of,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.58,0:18:19.56,Default,Ito,0,0,0,,what kind of relationship do you have \Nwith my little brother, exactly?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.72,0:18:21.62,Default,Mahiru,0,0,0,,With the boss?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.93,0:18:27.23,Default,Mahiru,0,0,0,,Did you like, get the wrong idea?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.23,0:18:27.93,Default,Mahiru,0,0,0,,Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.93,0:18:29.92,Default,Mahiru,0,0,0,,We're just work friends, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.92,0:18:31.74,Default,Mahiru,0,0,0,,Well, I just got here,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.74,0:18:33.91,Default,Mahiru,0,0,0,,so it's like I'm training the boss.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.91,0:18:36.06,Default,Gen,0,0,0,,Don't suggest that you're training me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.28,0:18:38.51,Sign,Sign,0,0,0,,{\frz357.3\fs20\fax-0.1\bord2\blur3\3c&HA7A7A7&\3a&HB8&\move(120,360,117.044,246.869,0,211)}Kou-kun
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.90,0:18:42.27,Default,Mahiru,0,0,0,,Looks like I'm getting \Npicked up, so I'll be off.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.57,0:18:44.14,Default,Mahiru,0,0,0,,See ya next time!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.60,0:18:49.08,Default,Gen,0,0,0,,Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.08,0:18:49.66,Default,Ito,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.66,0:18:50.86,Default,Gen,0,0,0,,Don't "yes" me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.86,0:18:52.28,Default,Gen,0,0,0,,What are you doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.28,0:18:56.71,Default,Ito,0,0,0,,Oh, this was just on my way \Nto do something else.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.71,0:18:59.78,Default,Ito,0,0,0,,I went to the convenience \Nstore and happened to pass by.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.78,0:19:01.33,Default,Gen,0,0,0,,Hmm...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.54,0:19:04.26,Default,Ito,0,0,0,,What's up with "boss," though?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.26,0:19:06.93,Default,Gen,0,0,0,,She said it sounds fancier than employee.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.93,0:19:08.55,Default,Ito,0,0,0,,Oh?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.55,0:19:09.54,Default,Gen,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.54,0:19:13.52,Default,Ito,0,0,0,,You just seemed pretty close, is all.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.02,0:19:19.05,Italics,Ito(M),0,0,0,,That came out bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.69,0:19:21.35,Default,Gen,0,0,0,,Say that again.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.56,0:19:25.70,Default,Gen,0,0,0,,Just because someone's a handful \Nat work does {\i1}not{\i0} mean we're close.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.70,0:19:29.43,Default,Gen,0,0,0,,Today she broke a bunch of plates \Nand dumped pasta on a customer, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.43,0:19:31.57,Default,Ito,0,0,0,,I... I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.57,0:19:33.03,Default,Gen,0,0,0,,But because she has motivation,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.03,0:19:34.76,Default,Gen,0,0,0,,I {\i1}will{\i0} successfully train her!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.76,0:19:37.32,Default,Ito,0,0,0,,It's good that you're \Ntaking the job seriously.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.97,0:19:40.65,Italics,Ito(M),0,0,0,,I didn't know that he had so \Nmuch pent up frustration...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.70,0:19:44.09,Italics,Ito(M),0,0,0,,Sorry for jumping to conclusions.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.64,0:19:51.09,Default,Ito,0,0,0,,Oh no, it started raining!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.37,0:19:53.09,Default,Ito,0,0,0,,I've gotta grab the laundry!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.30,0:19:56.02,Default,Ito,0,0,0,,I wanted to go shopping...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.02,0:19:57.84,Default,Raku,0,0,0,,I can go shopping instead.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.12,0:19:59.48,Default,Ito,0,0,0,,Sorry, Raku-kun!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.48,0:20:00.85,Default,Ito,0,0,0,,I'd appreciate it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.35,0:20:09.08,Default,Guy1,0,0,0,,She's pretty cute, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.08,0:20:11.09,Default,Guy2,0,0,0,,Is that a dating app?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.09,0:20:12.93,Default,Guy1,0,0,0,,Her personality seems good, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.57,0:20:14.92,Italics,Raku(M),0,0,0,,That reminds me,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.92,0:20:17.36,Italics,Raku(M),0,0,0,,I wonder if she's made any progress.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.04,0:20:20.44,Default,Raku,0,0,0,,What are you doing here?!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.28,0:20:23.62,Default,Yashiro,0,0,0,,Narita-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.10,0:20:27.16,Default,Yashiro,0,0,0,,As you can see, I'm taking \Nshelter from the rain.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.54,0:20:30.78,Default,Yashiro,0,0,0,,It's my day off, so I \Nthought I'd take a walk.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.16,0:20:33.28,Default,Yashiro,0,0,0,,That's a lie.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.28,0:20:38.13,Default,Yashiro,0,0,0,,I miraculously matched with a person, \Nbut they seem to have bailed on me.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.13,0:20:39.80,Italics,Raku(M),0,0,0,,Why the lie?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.80,0:20:41.38,Default,Yashiro,0,0,0,,It's fine, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.76,0:20:46.04,Default,Yashiro,0,0,0,,Actually, I basically started doing \Nthis so my parents wouldn't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.56,0:20:47.94,Default,Raku,0,0,0,,Any contact?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.94,0:20:51.86,Default,Yashiro,0,0,0,,I've been trying for three \Nhours, but I can't reach him.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.74,0:20:54.81,Default,Raku,0,0,0,,I'll walk you home.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.89,0:20:58.75,Default,Raku,0,0,0,,Go home, take a bath, \Nand eat something tasty.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.75,0:21:01.12,Default,Raku,0,0,0,,You'll forget about that guy in no time.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.49,0:21:09.33,Italics,Raku(M),0,0,0,,Though it's not like I've been in a proper\N relationship to be preaching like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.84,0:21:13.24,Default,Yashiro,0,0,0,,No lecture today?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.24,0:21:16.46,Default,Raku,0,0,0,,I'm not a monster who kicks \Nsomeone when they're down.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.84,0:21:18.57,Default,Yashiro,0,0,0,,I was just asking.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.98,0:21:22.30,Default,Yashiro,0,0,0,,It didn't quite feel \Nlike you without that.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.04,0:21:27.36,Italics,Raku(M),0,0,0,,Actually, I'm actually a bit \Nrelieved that she got rejected.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.18,0:21:30.88,Default,Yashiro,0,0,0,,Here is fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.96,0:21:35.46,Default,Yashiro,0,0,0,,I'd make you some tea \Nor something as thanks,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.46,0:21:37.98,Default,Yashiro,0,0,0,,but I really can't invite a student in.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.98,0:21:39.32,Default,Raku,0,0,0,,I understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.92,0:21:43.38,Italics,Raku(M),0,0,0,,She doesn't look as upset as I'd expect,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.74,0:21:45.33,Italics,Raku(M),0,0,0,,but she's someone...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.73,0:21:48.00,Default,Yashiro,0,0,0,,See you tomorrow at school, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.00,0:21:51.58,Italics,Raku(M),0,0,0,,I don't want to leave like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.10,0:21:58.17,Default,Raku,0,0,0,,Um...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.57,0:22:01.97,Italics,Raku(M),0,0,0,,Did I always stick my nose this \Nfar into people's business?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.56,0:22:04.05,Default,Raku,0,0,0,,Do you want to come with me—
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.05,0:22:05.76,Default,Yudai,0,0,0,,Azusa?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.33,0:22:09.68,Default,Yudai,0,0,0,,Who's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.68,0:22:11.98,Default,Yudai,0,0,0,,Could that be your new boyfriend?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.14,0:22:18.68,Default,Yudai,0,0,0,,Hello. Nice to meet you.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.44,0:22:23.65,Sign,Sign,0,0,0,,{\an9\fs15\bord1.5\shad2\c&HFFFFFF&\4c&HA259F6&\3c&HBA5A1D&}Translation: Jun Nozaki
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.90,0:22:27.49,Sign,Sign,0,0,0,,{\an7\fs15\bord1.5\shad2\c&HFFFFFF&\4c&HA259F6&\3c&HBA5A1D&}Timing: Andy Ellis
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.86,0:22:30.91,Sign,Sign,0,0,0,,{\an7\fs15\bord1.5\shad2\c&HFFFFFF&\4c&HA259F6&\3c&HBA5A1D&}Editing & Typesetting: Elisabeth Crist
